  "note": "Borough election polled Wednesday 17 May 1967; twelve councillors over the whole borough. All the Unionists but D. Forster were elected, with Mrs. Anderson (Independent) gaining a seat from the Unionists; percentage poll 48. The three aldermen elected in 1964 for six years were not due for election."
